  "content_description": "Action Item- Teams",
  "content_text_body": "The goal is to develop a work environment based on trust. \n\n \n\n ### Why is it important?\n\n \n\n When team members do not have trust, they may be afraid that speaking up will result in punishment, ridicule, or other consequences. This poor communication can prohibit them from doing their best work.\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n Use these [Team Tips for Building Trust](Team_Tips_for_Building_Trust) to get started.",
